sw-global-war-spawn-unavailable = This role cannot be entered right now.
sw-global-war-spawn-choose-faction = Choose a job of your intended faction or its civilian role.
sw-global-war-spawn-no-slots = No places: the post is taken or waits for a successor.
sw-global-war-spawn-requirement = A requirement of this post is not met.
sw-global-war-spawn-no-point = No safe place to appear. Wait: you will not be landed on an enemy point.
sw-global-war-spawn-force-world-lost = Your Force world is lost, so a Force carrier has nowhere to appear.
sw-global-war-spawn-faction-locked = You already fight for the other side, and it is locked until the round ends.
sw-global-war-spawn-life-active = Your character is still alive.
sw-global-war-spawn-life-unavailable = A new life is not available yet. { $seconds } s left after confirmed death.
sw-global-war-spawn-use-return = The term has passed. Come back through the return window.
sw-global-war-spawn-no-answer = The server did not confirm the entry.

sw-global-war-entry-chat = { $faction }, { $job }. { $planet }.
sw-global-war-entry-confirmed = Entry confirmed: { $faction }, { $job }. Place: { $planet }, surface.
sw-global-war-entry-task = Next task: { $task }
sw-global-war-entry-returned = New life: your former post did not carry over, and no combat kit was issued again.

sw-global-war-entry-returned-force = New life as a Force carrier: no saber was issued again, it stayed on your former body. Recover it there.

sw-global-war-first-task-head = check the capital's supply and choose a common task. After minute 20 declare war: while a head is in office, it does not start by itself.
sw-global-war-first-task-warminister = match people, transport and stock, then give a task that supply can back.
sw-global-war-first-task-logisticsminister = check food delivery and fix the nearest transport shortage.
sw-global-war-first-task-industryminister = check power, raw materials and base line output.
sw-global-war-first-task-logisticsworker = deliver a needed cargo along an available route.
sw-global-war-first-task-industryworker = fix a raw material shortage or a stopped machine.
sw-global-war-first-task-seniorofficer = prepare one workable defence or transport plan.
sw-global-war-first-task-juniorofficer = gather people, check comms, supplies and the return point.
sw-global-war-first-task-pilot = carry needed cargo or people with existing transport.
sw-global-war-first-task-soldier = get an available kit, check the local post and comms.
sw-global-war-first-task-forceuser = contact command and leave your world for a useful task.
sw-global-war-first-task-intelligence = get an intelligence question and check an available path.
sw-global-war-first-task-civilian = deliver needed rations or materials, or load a magazine. Joining the army is voluntary.
sw-global-war-first-task-default = contact your side and find useful work nearby.

sw-global-war-respawn-title = You died
sw-global-war-respawn-countdown = Return opens in { $time }. The term runs from confirmed death, and revival cancels it.
sw-global-war-respawn-ready = The term has passed. You may still be revived, or continue in a new life on the same side.
sw-global-war-respawn-rules = A new life ends this one: the body will no longer be yours. Your former post does not carry over, and no combat kit is issued again.
sw-global-war-respawn-civilian = Return as a citizen ({ $faction })
sw-global-war-respawn-force = Return as a Force carrier
sw-global-war-respawn-force-note = This character holds the Force place until you choose a return. A civilian return frees it. No saber is issued again: it stays on this body.
sw-global-war-respawn-stale = This return is out of date: the character's state has changed.
sw-global-war-respawn-revived = You were revived, so no return is needed.
sw-global-war-respawn-round-over = The round is over, so the return is closed.
sw-global-war-respawn-force-not-carrier = This character does not hold a Force place.

sw-global-war-latejoin-notice-overflow = Your side locks for the round only after a confirmed entry. If the place is taken, you enter as a citizen of the same side.
sw-global-war-latejoin-notice-stay = Your side locks for the round only after a confirmed entry. If the place is taken, you stay in the lobby.
sw-global-war-latejoin-pending = Request sent, waiting for the server.
sw-global-war-latejoin-role-full = { $jobName }: no places
sw-global-war-latejoin-role-free = { $jobName }: free places { $amount }
sw-global-war-latejoin-role-open = { $jobName }: no place limit
